  "bio": "Welcome to MrK Tattoo Studio, where artistry meets precision in the heart of La Courneuve, France. Specializing in geometric and illustrative tattoos, our boutique studio at 120 Avenue Henri Barbusse, 92600 Asnieres sur Seine provides a unique and serene environment for transforming your ideas into timeless ink. Connect with us at mrktattoo1@gmail.com or blackparlortattoo.info@gmail.com to embark on your bespoke tattoo journey.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: La Courneuve, Ile-de-france, France"
